      "helpPhone": "(215) 686-6442",
      "body": "Apply through the Philadelphia Tax Center or use the paper application on the program page. You do not need an online account or a down payment to enroll.\n\n- Include proof of income and two forms of proof that you live at the property, including government-issued photo ID.\n- Ask for a review of income and expenses if the proposed monthly payment is unaffordable.\n- New property taxes may still be due separately. Confirm what your agreement covers."
